hich is enough to power more than 12.1 million U.S. homes.\nAmazon also announced four new utility-scale wind and solar projects with a combined total capacity of 934 megawatts (MW). They include a 234 MW wind farm in Karnataka, Amazon’s largest wind project contracted in Asi"}}
